@startuml
title "Update an operation requesition"

actor Doctor
participant "System" as Sys



Doctor -> Sys : Request to remove an operation requisition

        Sys --> Doctor: you want to remove this operation requisition?
        Doctor -> Sys: yes remove
activate Sys


alt Doctor not Allowed
        Doctor <--Sys : response status 405 
else Operation Request successfully
        Doctor <--Sys : response status 200
deactivate Sys
end


@enduml
